window.FD_CHANGELOG = {"version":"1.6.0","date":"2026-11-18","intro":"A calmer Feature Hunt, a clearer Daily Challenge and a fairer Speed Bonus.","game":[{"title":"A calmer Feature Hunt","text":"The hint-o-meter, score card and difficulty are gone while you play. Hint 1 of 5 now says how many guesses are left, ending in a Final guess, and the last hint turns the nudge into I give up."},{"title":"A cleaner finish","text":"The answer is written out plainly, your hints and guesses are tucked into one click, and every puzzle ends the same way: a Next round button and About the feature."},{"title":"One round tracker everywhere","text":"Free Play, Feature Hunt, Scenario Match, Prompt Lab and Packs all show the same line under the heading: Round 2 of 5 (Puzzle 2 of 46 in a pack), with your points so far. The coloured dots and the small blue round text are gone."},{"title":"A Speed Bonus that counts down","text":"The Daily Challenge starts at 40 bonus points and loses 1 every 3 seconds, ending at 0 after 2 minutes. A clock tells you when it ends."},{"title":"A bigger streak bonus","text":"Every day of your Daily streak now adds 5% bonus XP, up to 100%."},{"title":"Tidier menus and wording","text":"One set of descriptions for every way to play, a shorter More menu on phones, and the Play tab always takes you back to the game modes."},{"title":"A clearer About page","text":"Fresh wording for the game modes, how they work, scoring and the Daily Challenge, with every difficulty lined up and a Data usage note."},{"title":"A clearer Stats page and Leaderboard","text":"XP to go is labelled, a Total score joins the key numbers, the road to Copilot Champion shows your current XP, ticks the ranks you have passed and previews the border of every rank still to come, every rank\u0027s border stands out on the blue banner, and profiles show the name beside the icon with a rank and four numbers."},{"title":"More control in Settings","text":"Hide yourself from the leaderboard, create a desktop or phone app with one button, and erase your account data in one step."},{"title":"Tidier puzzle endings","text":"Scenario Match and Prompt Lab results no longer list pick numbers and points, Change settings sits beside Play again, and Quick Draw is now a Daily Challenge badge."},{"title":"Rank bars and Prompt Lab polish","text":"Copilot Coach and Copilot Champion XP bars slowly shift through the colours of their borders. Prompt Lab scenarios now open with You\u0027re using the feature, in colour, and Scenario Match no longer shows the difficulty above its heading."}],"microsoft":[],"microsoftEmpty":"No new Microsoft updates for now","history":[{"version":"1.5.1","date":"2026-11-17","notes":["One word for difficulty everywhere, and updates that show up the moment you open the game."]},{"version":"1.5.0","date":"2026-11-17","notes":["A clearer Feature Tracker with striped and solid bars, and a What makes a good prompt? guide in Prompt Lab.","A tidier Play tab, and Home tiles that lead with the three game modes."]},{"version":"1.4.0","date":"2026-11-16","notes":["Free Play and Feature Hunt are played in rounds, from 1 to 10, and the Free Play timer is gone.","Every difficulty is open from the start, and the Feature Book shows every prompt.","A tidier Prompt Lab results page, a lined-up Feature Tracker and three new badges."]},{"version":"1.3.0","date":"2026-11-16","notes":["Free Play mixes all three game modes, and Category and Feature became drop-downs that let you tick several.","The Feature Tracker, a clearer Feature Book and one Prompt it list for every feature.","Scenario Match and Prompt Lab give three picks, worth 50, 30 and 10 points, and the Speed Bonus belongs to the Daily Challenge.","A simpler Home and Stats."]},{"version":"1.2.0","date":"2026-11-16","notes":["Three game modes: Feature Hunt, Scenario Match and Prompt Lab.","Free Play, Packs and the Daily Challenge draw puzzles from all three.","A richer Feature Book, a Copilot Essentials pack, and new Most puzzles and Mastery rankings. Team Battle retired."]},{"version":"1.1.0","date":"2026-11-14","notes":["Made the game even more awesome."]}]};
